   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The  destination of the underground railroad changed with the passage of the Compromise of 1850 because ",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1169804,
     "content_html": "Canada’s government guaranteed safe passage for runaway slaves\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169803,
     "content_html": "completion of the Erie Canal made it quicker and cheaper to get to New York City\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169802,
     "content_html": "many economic opportunities existed in the new western territories\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169805,
     "content_html": "the new fugitive slave law increased the risks for escapees\n"
    }
